    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOPEN VIEWING: Thursday 24th September 2pm-2.30pm sharp\n\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis two bedroom townhouse is ideally located within walking distance of all local amenities and is within easy access of Kilkee beach. Accommodation is well proportioned comprising 00 sq.m. and includes an open plan sititng room and dining area, kitchen, ground floor toilet, two bathrooms and two bedrooms. Externally, there is an elevated patio and seating area with some lovely views, a low maintenance garden area and a generous storage shed. Due to the size and location of this property it would make an ideal starter home or investment property for long or short term lettings. Viewings are recommended to appreciate what is on offer. BER D2."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nSitting Room/Dining Area - \nOpen plan contemporary layout complete with wood effect tiled flooring, solid fuel stove and tv point.\n\nKitchen - \nThe kitchen is complete with fully fitted wall and base units, granite work tops, wood effect tiled flooring and recessed spot lighting, Rear access\n\nToilet - \nIdeally located on the ground floor complete with wc and whb.\n\nLanding - \nWith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - \nDouble bedroom located to the front of the property and complete with carpet flooring, casement style windows and recessed closet space.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled and complete with timber effect tiled flooring, electric shower, wc, whb and a heated rail.\n\nLanding area - \nWith carpet flooring. Access to attic area.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nDouble bedroom also located to the front of the property and complete with carpet flooring, casement style windows.\n\nBathroom - \nComplete with shower, wc, whb, wood effect tiled flooring and a heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Two bedroom townhouse located close to all local amenities and easy access of Kilkee beach</li><li>Offered for sale in turn key condition</li><li>Well proportioned accommodation</li><li>External elevated patio and seating area</li><li>OFCH and solid fuel stove</li><li>Ideal starter home or investment property</ul>"
      },
